{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִיפַז","hw":"אֱלִיפַז","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיפַז</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God is fine gold</em>?<strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  son of Esau <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:4\" href=\"/Genesis.36.4\">Gn 36:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:10\" href=\"/Genesis.36.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:11\" href=\"/Genesis.36.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:12\" href=\"/Genesis.36.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:16\" href=\"/Genesis.36.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.35\">1 Ch 1:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.36\">36</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  friend of Job <a data-ref=\"Job 2:11\" href=\"/Job.2.11\">Jb 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 4:1\" href=\"/Job.4.1\">4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 15:1\" href=\"/Job.15.1\">15:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:1\" href=\"/Job.22.1\">22:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 42:7\" href=\"/Job.42.7\">42:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 42:9\" href=\"/Job.42.9\">9</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִיפָל","prev":"BDB, אֱלִיעָם"}